function calls related with page fault.
=20
Later,  i start and stop the tracer to see the messages coming from
tracer.
prctl(0, 1);
prctl(0, 0);
=20
I see that most of them are tracing related. Is there a way to clear
tracing related latency from the output or is this special to my
configuration.
=20
you can find the output of trace attached to this email.
=20

My kernel 2.6.22.1-rt9 on an smp box.
regards,
